<BlogLayout
  title="remove.bg Is Shutting Down: What's Changing and a Free Alternative"
  description="remove.bg's standalone website closes on December 1, 2026. Here's what happens to the web app, the API, and your credits, plus a free, private background remover that runs in your browser."
  date="October 2026"
